played the demo on a live stream and helped us discover this bug.Sorry for the inconvenience. If you run into any problems, please let us know anytime. Thank you!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:29:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037128","verified_at":"2026-10-23T17:26:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3555790-1845383656390715","game_id":"steam-3555790","kind":"update","title":"Hint System Update","summary":"We've changed the hint system we added last time so that it's available starting from Chapter 2.Hints are available from Chapter 2 onward.Silver coins appear on screen once Chapter 2 unlocks. You still earn silver coins for first-time stage clears in Chapter 1.The Hint and Record buttons appear the first time you replay a stage you've cleared.🎮 Demo The demo only includes Chapter 1, so hints and silver coins don't appear there. Silver coins you earn in the demo carry over to the full game.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T07:53:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390715","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3555790-1845383656383609","game_id":"steam-3555790","kind":"announcement","title":"Hint System & Silver Coins","summary":"Hi, this is Dice Tiny Town! We've added a hint system for stages where a perfect clear 🍎 just won't come together.🪙 Earning Silver CoinsClear a stage for the first time: 1 silver coinFinish a Challenge Mode run: 2 silver coins, with more for going past the trophy scoreYour play from before this update earns silver coins too.💡 Three Hint Steps On any stage you've cleared, the \"Hint\" button at the top shows how to get a perfect clear, one step at a time. Each step opens only after the one before i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T18:55:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383609","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3555790-1844751498229154","game_id":"steam-3555790","kind":"update","title":"Chapter 1 Update","summary":"Stages 1-1 to 1-5 have been restructured to optimize difficulty balance and improve the tutorial.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T12:56:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498229154","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3555790-1844115010488603","game_id":"steam-3555790","kind":"update","title":"Image Update","summary":"2026-09-16 Beta UpdateReplaced the title screen image.Added Summer, Autumn, and Winter backgrounds.Made other minor UI improvements and fine-tuned stage target scores.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T09:37:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010488603","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3555790-1843481262702771","game_id":"steam-3555790","kind":"update","title":"Chapter 1 Update","summary":"Removed stage : 1-7 (the later stages have shifted forward to fill the gaps)Redesigned stage : 1-3, 1-12, 1-14Added stage : 1-20","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T19:15:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702771","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3555790-1843481262699682","game_id":"steam-3555790","kind":"update","title":"2026-09-13 Demo Update","summary":"2026-09-13 Demo UpdateFixed inconsistent or confusing terminology in translations across languages.Chapter 1 stages have changed: stages 1-5, 1-11, and 1-12 have been removed, and the later stages have shifted forward to fill the gaps. The old stage 1-20 is now 1-19, and stages 1-17, 1-18, and 1-20 have been redesigned.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T15:15:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262699682","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3555790":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:15Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:14Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3555790":"2026-10-26T10:39:15Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3555790":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:14Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:14Z"},"5070940":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:15Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3555790","app_id":3555790,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:18Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"d6608e7b0e668a6fe29d8b2c16baf4503853e7447271e3d1dfb56060e2467a11","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"주사위로 짓는 아기자기한 타운 빌딩 퍼즐. 매 턴 주사위 3개가 정해주는 모양·건물·자연을 스케치북 위 작은 마을에 요리조리 끼워 넣으세요 — 포근하지만 